  "details": "# Wordy intro\n\nThis is a minor but incredibly annoying thing that's been in the game for a very long time since smoothing was added to controller positions maybe two years ago?\n\nI haven't tested it on standalone quest but it might be present there too. I can return and update this.\n\nAs you move your head, your laser to interact with items will visually remain still, but the position that gets clicked is offset. This causes missed UI buttons. \n\n# TL;DR:\n\nWhere the UI is clicked doesn't line up with the pointer/laser. Easiest way to replicate the bug is to hold the trigger on a scrollable menu and pitch your head up and down. Watch as the menu scrolls without moving your hands. This exists on stable and beta.",
